{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639550/extras/950751a80abbed7acc6c24fe4a3d1bd4.avif?t=1759698853\" width=680 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into an abandoned warehouse equipped with bone-chilling  and unique atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639550/extras/dbf06e4449689fd654416c19c4a9e6ef.poster.avif?t=1759698853\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639550/extras/dbf06e4449689fd654416c19c4a9e6ef.webm?t=1759698853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639550/extras/dbf06e4449689fd654416c19c4a9e6ef.mp4?t=1759698853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639550/extras/a39d11d0626fcfb16fbaffff0e5a1788.avif?t=1759698853\" width=680 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay glued to the edge of your seat and avoid (or meet) your demise through this stealth based abomination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639550/extras/75d2007fea41bd40878cd45dd695f798.poster.avif?t=1759698853\" width=858 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639550/extras/75d2007fea41bd40878cd45dd695f798.webm?t=1759698853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639550/extras/75d2007fea41bd